@baseUrl = http://localhost:4002
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-token

### Public published list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/blog?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Public detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/blog/welcome-to-our-new-website
Accept: application/json

### Drafts and authoring require an administrator bearer token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/blog
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "example-draft",
  "title": "Example draft",
  "description": "A sufficiently descriptive search summary for the example draft.",
  "body": "<p>This is the first paragraph of the example draft.</p><p>This is its second paragraph.</p>",
  "author": "CompanyHQ team",
  "isDraft": true
}

### Update a post without changing its stable slug
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/blog/example-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated example draft",
  "description": "An updated search summary with enough detail for the request body.",
  "body": "<p>The updated first paragraph contains enough content for this example request.</p>",
  "author": "CompanyHQ team",
  "isDraft": true
}

### Delete a post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/blog/example-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Missing detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/blog/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### 401 without an administrator token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/blog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "unauthorised-example",
  "title": "Unauthorised example",
  "description": "This request should never reach the authoring service.",
  "body": "This request should be rejected before a blog row is written.",
  "author": "CompanyHQ team"
}

### Match a keyword against one field of the caller's shape; leave field out to match every text field
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/blog?field=category&keyword=news

### A field the caller's shape does not carry (isDraft for an anonymous reader): 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/blog?field=isDraft&keyword=true

### Save a ready, owned Content image as the managed cover; invalid owner/scope/state: 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/blog/example-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":"Article with uploaded cover",
  "description":"A description of the article with its uploaded cover image.",
  "body":"<h2>Heading</h2><p>Article <strong>HTML</strong> is passed through.</p>",
  "author":"CompanyHQ team","category":"Updates","isDraft":true,
  "coverMediaObjectId":"replace-with-ready-content-image-id"
}
